{"4738290":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Coin Pusher For My Wife","steam_appid":4738290,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coin Pusher For My Wife is a custom made version of the popular coin pusher machines found in arcades. I designed every level with input from my wife to make this as cozy and fun to play as possible. My wife and I love spending time at the arcade and if she wanders off alone I know I can find her at a coin pusher. We both hope you'll also enjoy it!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features five levels that each play a little differently from another. Some levels have plinko, stage hazards, missing side walls, coin towers and more. <\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels start players off with varying amount of coins depending on the difficulty of the level. Coins are generous, so success is achievable on every level with a little bit of luck. The goal is collect all ten unique-to-level prizes to win. Players can continue playing after collecting ten prizes to see how far they can go. <\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coins can be dropped manually or set to automatic mode for easy idle gameplay. <\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once in game, the game is played entirely on keyboard using WASD or arrow keys. Mouse is used only for navigating menus. <\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coin Pusher For My Wife is a custom made version of the popular coin pusher machines found in arcades. I designed every level with input from my wife to make this as cozy and fun to play as possible. My wife and I love spending time at the arcade and if she wanders off alone I know I can find her at a coin pusher. We both hope you'll also enjoy it!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features five levels that each play a little differently from another. Some levels have plinko, stage hazards, missing side walls, coin towers and more. <\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels start players off with varying amount of coins depending on the difficulty of the level. Coins are generous, so success is achievable on every level with a little bit of luck. The goal is collect all ten unique-to-level prizes to win. Players can continue playing after collecting ten prizes to see how far they can go. <\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coins can be dropped manually or set to automatic mode for easy idle gameplay. <\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once in game, the game is played entirely on keyboard using WASD or arrow keys. Mouse is used only for navigating menus. <\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"Coin Pusher For My Wife is my take on the classic coin pusher games found in arcades. I created every level with input from my wife. This game is designed to be a relaxing and cozy game to help take your mind off the crushing reality of having to decide what to eat for dinner.","supported_languages":"영어","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4738290\/c113bd3b02c9d2d6e8e2df06f20f56e8ff674c1f\/header.jpg?t=1783677896","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4738290\/1e0c7cd1a2d2a966977e9843480f8bcdd9d4f7ce\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783677896","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4738290\/1e0c7cd1a2d2a966977e9843480f8bcdd9d4f7ce\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783677896","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<stron